Now, if we come in and look at some of these, so this was one of the standard prompts from Deep Seek to basically just get it to do, you know, things like the Eiffel Tower and stuff like that.

179
00:17:25,824 --> 00:17:30,944
Not the best sort of things out of here, which is probably more telling about that.

180
00:17:31,024 --> 00:17:35,824
This model is not necessarily being sort of RL'd for this kind of task.

181
